gb4x(){return"Choose the type that fits your situation. A greyed-out option means its rule isn't met for your current dates, hours, or balance.\n\n\u2022 Annual \u2014 planned time off. Needs available or carry-forward balance, is subject to your yearly allowance. If you have overtime balance, use Compensation first.\n\n\u2022 Emergency \u2014 sudden, same-day needs. Limited to one day and requires available annual/carry-forward balance.\n\n\u2022 Compensation \u2014 spends your overtime balance. Available only when that balance covers the requested days.\n\n\u2022 Sick \u2014 for illness. Requires uploading a sick note.\n\n\u2022 Unpaid \u2014 time off without pay. Available only when you have little or no paid balance left."},
